   "body": "## Description\n\nTest-redistribute workflow is currently [failes](https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi/actions/runs/45331075789/job/138232168059#step:9:111) due to breaking changes in Sentry 3.x ([transaction-based tracing has been removed](https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/python/migration/2.x-to-3.x)).\n\n## AI Disclaimer\n\nUsed Codex (gpt-6 Astra) to investigate and apply the fix. Checked manually\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] This PR links to a GitHub Discussion for the proposed code change.\n- [ ] I added tests for the change.\n- [ ] The new or updated tests fail on the main branch and pass on this PR.\n- [x] Coverage stays at 100%.\n- [ ] The documentation explains the change if needed.\n",
