   "body": "### Summary\nThis PR adds test coverage for `OAuth2AuthorizationCodeBearer` when used with `auto_error=False` (mirroring the existing `test_security_oauth2_password_bearer_optional.py`) and removes the now-unnecessary `# pragma: nocover`.\n\n### Changes\n1. Added `tests/test_security_oauth2_authorization_code_bearer_optional.py` covering:\n   - Missing `Authorization` header returns `None`\n   - Valid `Bearer` token returns the token\n   - Invalid / non-Bearer scheme returns `None`\n   - Valid OpenAPI schema generation\n2. Added `tests/test_security_oauth2_authorization_code_bearer_optional_description.py` covering the optional mode with custom description.\n3. Removed `# pragma: nocover` on the `return None` branch in `fastapi/security/oauth2.py` as it is now covered.\n\n### Checklist\n- [x] Run unit tests locally (`pytest`)\n- [x] No breaking runtime changes introduced",
